/cleaning/Elections:

- /Code/1_getting_likud_percentage.R: creates dataset of Likud's vote share for each locality for all elections from 2006 to 2022.
  - input: /raw/Elections/
  - output: /Output/likud_percentage.csv

- /Code/2_getting_right_wing_percentage.R: creates dataset of the Right-Wing block's vote share for each locality for all elections from 2006 to 2022.
  - input: /raw/Elections/
  - output: /Output/right_wing_percentage.csv
